// One-Eyed Hector's casket, Pirate's Treasure's 2011 reward (obj 7956: void-634's
// casket_pirates_treasure; not in 289, which gave its contents loose). The message is the 2011-04-26
// recording's (YouTube GTgKzVezVDo, 502s); the contents are the 2011 wiki's (Pirate's Treasure,
// 2011-04-17: "450 coins, a cut emerald and a gold ring"), 289's loose reward.
[opheld1,casket_7956]
inv_del(inv, casket_7956, 1);
inv_add(inv, coins, 450);
inv_add(inv, emerald, 1);
inv_add(inv, gold_ring, 1);
mes("You open the casket, and find One-Eyed Hector's treasure.");
